        "width": 928,
        "height": 1296,
        "content": "## Automated B2B Lead Generation with CoreSignal, Apify & Google Sheets\n\nThis n8n template helps automate B2B lead generation by sourcing targeted decision makers, enriching their contact information, and organizing everything in Google Sheets.\n\nSimply define your target industry, company size, region, and the number of companies you want to find. The workflow uses CoreSignal to source relevant companies and decision makers, Apify to enrich and verify contact information, and Google Sheets to store and manage your leads.\n\n### Use cases\n\nThis template is useful for:\n\n* Finding targeted B2B leads based on specific criteria\n* Sourcing decision makers from relevant companies\n* Enriching leads with professional email and LinkedIn information\n* Verifying email addresses before outreach\n* Building and maintaining a structured lead database\n* Preparing qualified leads for sales or outreach campaigns\n\n### How it works\n\n* Submit your lead criteria through the built-in n8n form, including industry, company size, region, and the number of companies you want to find.\n* CoreSignal searches for matching companies and decision makers based on your criteria.\n* The workflow stores the initial lead information in Google Sheets, including company name, contact name, title, LinkedIn URL, and profile score.\n* Apify is used to find additional contact information from LinkedIn profiles.\n* The workflow sends available email addresses to an email verification service through Apify.\n* Verified email information and lead status are updated in Google Sheets.\n* You can then use the verified leads from the spreadsheet for your sales or outreach process.\n\n### How to use\n\n* Set up the provided Google Sheets lead database.\n* Connect your CoreSignal API account.\n* Connect your Apify account.\n* Submit your target industry, company size, region, and desired number of leads through the n8n form.\n* Run the workflow and let it source, enrich, and verify your leads.\n* Review the resulting leads in Google Sheets and use the verified contacts for your outreach process.\n\n### Requirements\n\n* n8n\n* CoreSignal account\n* Apify account\n* Google account / Google Sheets\n* A Google Sheet for storing your leads\n\n### Example Google Sheet Link\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1mBIbUCplpcyK2QJSuSC7WbXx7TavrMbAZJ_L_O3kxmE/edit?usp=sharing"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
